& \overset{\hand{\sim}}{\mathrm{LH}}.(X) \ar[dl, "\hand{}"'] & \\
\mathrm{LH}.(e)=Z\hand{[}0\hand{]} \ar[rr] & & \mathrm{LH}.(X) \ar[ul, "\hand{}"']
\end{tikzcd}} \qquad ,

where X is any object in Hot$^\bullet$ and LH.(X) is short for LH.($\hand{\beta}$(X)). Of
course the functors $\overset{\hand{\sim}}{\mathrm{LH}}$ and $\overset{\hand{\sim}}{K}_{\hand{\pi}}$ are still adjoint\inserted[typed]{(one hopes !)}, hence for any pointed
homotopy type X an adjunction map in H\unsure{o}t$^\bullet$

(6') \qquad $X \longrightarrow \overset{\hand{\sim}}{K}\ (\overset{\hand{\sim}}{\mathrm{LH}}.(X))$ \quad ,

